# KOS / PvP Server

Ashes of Humanity is a **PvP server with KOS enabled**.

Players are free to engage in PvP encounters unless restricted by specific server rules.

---

## Safe Zone

The only safe zone on the server is near **Zapadilsko**.

The safe zone can be identified by the surrounding water towers.
